OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhat should residents worried
OL,4,Aabout cancer-causing forever chemicals
OL,5,Ado?
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat should residents who are worried
OL,8,Fabout this do now? We asked
OL,9,FLancashire's director of public health
OL,10,FDr Sakthi Karunanithi for his reaction
OL,11,Fto the results and his message to
OL,12,Fresidents.
OL,14,FThe area in Thornton-Cleveleys has been
OL,15,Funder investigation for years by the
OL,16,FEnvironment Agency over contamination
OL,17,Fof soils and locally grown food from
OL,18,Fthe substance used to manufacture
OL,19,Fnon-stick frying pans until 2012.
